{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46205","headline":"山居诗二十四首 十九 · 贯休","name":"山居诗二十四首 十九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露滴红兰玉满畦，闲拖象屣到峯西。\n但令心似莲花洁，何必身将槁木齐。\n古壍细烟红树老，半岩残雪白猨啼。\n虽然不是桃源洞，春至桃花亦满蹊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46205.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46205","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}